__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Raw dataset images (~680 MB, ~75k files) are deliberately NOT git-tracked: they are
# redistributions of GTSRB / TT100K-Signs / LISA-Signs under those datasets' own licenses
# (see README.md "License"), and committing tens of thousands of small files caused repeated
# git corruption on this NFS-backed filesystem. The files remain on disk for local use; see
# README.md / ENVIRONMENT.md for how to (re)obtain each dataset.
/data/
note/tables/
note/ANALYSIS_RAW.md
note/figures/
outputs/ALL_RQ_DATA.txt
outputs/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
# Scratch verification runs (this session's own reproduction smoke tests), not shipped artifacts
outputs/repro_grid/
outputs/repro_run_real*/
artifacts/torch_cache/
outputs/_arachne_feat_cache/
# Checkpoint binaries (backbones, DynaPatch repair checkpoints, DPGate coefficients) are not
# shipped as part of this artifact (~2.2 GB) -- see README.md "Known limitations". All of them
# now live under artifacts/checkpoints/ (2026-09-21: moved off outputs/, which only ever held
# them because that's where the Hydra training scripts happened to write; see MANIFEST.md).
# artifacts/checkpoints/baselines/'s OWN manifest.json/MANIFEST.md are tracked (small, metadata
# only); the binaries under backbones/, dynapatch/, gates/, AND baselines/ (72 files, ~6.6 GB --
# discovered 2026-09-21 via a `git add -A` that hung for minutes hashing them) are all ignored --
# none of this artifact's checkpoint binaries are shipped, see README.md "Known limitations".
artifacts/checkpoints/backbones/
artifacts/checkpoints/dynapatch/
artifacts/checkpoints/gates/
artifacts/checkpoints/baselines/*/*/*.pt
# Raw per-sample prediction dumps (~24 GB total, not this artifact's to ship) -- needed
# locally to actually refit/reproduce DPGate (scripts/gate_lambda_sweep.py, gate_protocol_b.py,
# analyze_response_gate_lobo.py, analysis_gate_transplant.py, analysis_p1_regression.py); the
# CSV outputs those scripts write ARE the shipped evidence, this raw input is not.
outputs/effect_dump*/
outputs/_response_gate_cache*/
outputs/prior_patch_persample/
outputs/gate_persample*/
# NN-Patching/PatchNAS's cached penultimate/stage features (scripts/dump_prior_features.py).
# Deleted 2026-09-21: cached from a backbone_registry.py path that no longer exists on disk
# (outputs/exp_..._public_v2), so it could silently be scoring against different backbone weights
# than the rest of the pipeline. scripts/checkpoint_eval/{nnpatch,patchnas}.py now default to
# extracting these features live from the canonical backbone checkpoint instead (--features live).
artifacts/prior_feats/
outputs/checkpoint_eval/
outputs/from_checkpoints/
# Intermediate per-cell/per-setting stepping stones on the way to the shipped summary.csv --
# never tracked in the original repo either; only the final summary a paper table reads ships.
outputs/rq2/m1_correction_direction/
outputs/rq2/alignment/per_cell.csv
outputs/rq2/alignment/per_setting.csv
outputs/rq2/margin_decomposition/per_cell.csv
outputs/rq2/margin_decomposition/per_setting.csv
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_v1/config.json
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_v1/SUMMARY.md
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_v1/per_cell.csv
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_nnpatching_v1/config.json
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_nnpatching_v1/SUMMARY.md
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_nnpatching_v1/per_cell.csv
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_patchnas_v1/config.json
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_patchnas_v1/SUMMARY.md
outputs/rq2/patch_reassignment_patchnas_v1/per_cell.csv
